(lang dune 3.0)

; coh-min: the minimal standalone CM runtime tracer (M2), destined to become
; `coh cm run`. Its OWN build root, stdlib-only (no yojson/menhir/ppx/unix),
; every dependency in-tree under lib/. It shares NO code with the frozen `coh`
; engine (src/engine/ocaml). It harvests the link/execute/emit skeleton and the
; JSON/SHA-256 libraries from the Ascent-0 runtime, generalized to run an
; ordinary CM: it loads a NormalizedCMIR, links a SandboxExecutionPlan, executes
; a finite provider DAG by input readiness, invokes real provider backends, and
; emits one MeasurementReceipt. The first CM it runs is `example.readme-present`.
